1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,419
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,419 --> 00:00:11,601
If the line is in the form y equals m x plus c and the circle is centred at the origin, use c squared equals a squared, one plus m squared.

3
00:00:11,601 --> 00:00:15,924
Otherwise, use distance from the centre equals the radius.

